          <li>Wikipedia, <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dvorak_keyboard_layout" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Dvorak keyboard layout</a>, 2026 (a 1956 US government study and later reviews found no decisive real-world speed advantage over QWERTY).</li>
          <li>Typing.com, <a href="https://typingcom.helpscoutdocs.com/article/15-differences-between-free-and-premium-accounts" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Differences between free and premium accounts</a>, 2026 (the free tier shows ads; an ad-free experience is a paid benefit).</li>
